flowchart TD
  U[User] --> FE[Frontend]
  FE --> API[URL API]
  API --> V[Validate URL]
  V --> G[Generate unique code]
  G --> DB[(Database)]
  DB --> R[Return short URL]
  U2[Visitor] --> RED[Redirect endpoint]
  RED --> C[(Cache)]
  C -->|Hit| DEST[Original URL]
  C -->|Miss| DB
  DB --> DEST
  DEST --> OUT[HTTP Redirect]
